{title: Jaaneman Jaaneman Tere Do Nayan}
{artist: Chhoti Si Baat Salil Chowdhury Asha Bhosle Yesudas}
{key: Bb}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bb]Jaaneman! Jaaneman!
[D#]Tere do nayan,
[F]Chori chori leke gaye,
[D#]dekho, mera maan,
[F]Jaaneman! Jaaneman![Bb]Jaaneman!
[Bb]Mere do nayan,[D#]chor nahi sajan.
[F]Tumse hi khoya hoga,
[D#]tehki, tumhaara maan,
[F]Jaaneman! Jaaneman![Bb]Jaaneman!

{c: Verse 1}
[Bb]Tod de diloon ki doori.
[Bb]Aisi kya hai majburi
[Bb]Dil dil se mil[F]ne de!
Hah![Eb]Abhi to hui hai yaari,
[Eb]abhi se hi beqaraari,
[F]Din to zaraa dhal[F]ne de

{c: Verse 1}
Yehi[Bb]sunte, sa[F]majhte,
gu[Eb]zar gaye[F]jaane
kit[Bb]ne hi saawan

{c: Verse 1}
[Bb]Sang sang chale mere.
[Bb]Maare aage peechhe pherey ?
[Bb]Samjhoon main tere i[F]rraday.
[Eb]Dosh tera hai yeh to,
[Eb]har din jab dekho,
[F]Karti ho jhoothhe[F]waade!
repeat
Tu na[Bb]jaane, dee[F]waane,
di[Eb]khaoon tuj[F]he kaise main yeh
[Bb]dil ki lagan.

{c: Verse 1}
[Bb]Chhedenge kabhi na tumhe,
[Bb]zara batlado hamein,
[Bb]Kab tak ham tar[F]senge?
[Eb]Aise ghabhraao nahi,
[Eb]kabhi to kahin na kahin,
[F]Baadal ye bar[F]senge!
Kya[Bb]karenge, ba[F]raske,
ki[Eb]jab mur[F]jhaayega yeh
[Bb]saara chamaan?
